<!-- Loading screen + hero image scatter animation -->
<AboutHero />

<!--
  Permanent spacer: keeps 100dvh of document flow reserved so the
  about-scroll content always starts at scrollY = 100dvh.
  The hero stays position:fixed forever (never settles into the flow),
  so this spacer is never removed — it IS the scroll offset.
-->
